#: scripts/campaign/mission_e3_02.gd:56
msgid "Fodder"
msgstr "Fourrage"

#. [&"narrator", "Night on Lark Hill. Two armies asleep in their armour, and one woman who never sleeps."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e3_02.gd:117
msgid "Night on Lark Hill. Two armies asleep in their armour, and one woman who never sleeps."
msgstr "La nuit sur Lark Hill. Deux armées endormies dans leurs armures, et une femme qui ne dort jamais."

#. [&"malrik", "Four wagons, Hush. Grain, arrows, oil, fodder. Hungry armies march slowly."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e3_02.gd:118
msgid "Four wagons, Hush. Grain, arrows, oil, fodder. Hungry armies march slowly."
msgstr "Quatre chariots, Hush. Grain, flèches, huile, fourrage. Une armée affamée marche lentement."

#. [&"hush", "And the people in the tents, Bishop?"],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e3_02.gd:119
msgid "And the people in the tents, Bishop?"
msgstr "Et les gens dans les tentes, Évêque ?"

#. [&"malrik", "Wagons. Not tents. I grew up burying people who starved in tents."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e3_02.gd:120
msgid "Wagons. Not tents. I grew up burying people who starved in tents."
msgstr "Les chariots. Pas les tentes. J'ai grandi en enterrant des gens morts de faim dans des tentes."

#. [&"hush", "One wagon. Its wheels will not turn again."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e3_02.gd:122
msgid "One wagon. Its wheels will not turn again."
msgstr "Un chariot. Ses roues ne tourneront plus."

#. [&"hush", "The old man. Awake, of course. He was awake that night too."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e3_02.gd:123
msgid "The old man. Awake, of course. He was awake that night too."
msgstr "Le vieux. Réveillé, évidemment. Il était réveillé cette nuit-là aussi."

#. [&"malrik", "Then do not wake him further. Be the quiet thing in the dark."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e3_02.gd:124
msgid "Then do not wake him further. Be the quiet thing in the dark."
msgstr "Alors ne le réveille pas davantage. Sois la chose silencieuse dans le noir."

#. [&"hush", "There she sleeps. The little queen. One step, Bishop. Just one."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e3_02.gd:125
msgid "There she sleeps. The little queen. One step, Bishop. Just one."
msgstr "La voilà qui dort. La petite reine. Un pas, Évêque. Juste un."

#. [&"malrik", "Not tonight. Tonight we starve them. Knives are for another night."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e3_02.gd:126
msgid "Not tonight. Tonight we starve them. Knives are for another night."
msgstr "Pas ce soir. Ce soir, on les affame. Les couteaux, c'est pour une autre nuit."

#. [&"ashby", "Up! Up! Shadow in the camp! Torches, all of you!"],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e3_02.gd:127
msgid "Up! Up! Shadow in the camp! Torches, all of you!"
msgstr "Debout ! Debout ! L'Ombre est dans le camp ! Des torches, tout le monde !"

#. [&"messenger", "The Shadow's in the camp! Wake up!"],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e3_02.gd:128
msgid "The Shadow's in the camp! Wake up!"
msgstr "L'Ombre est dans le camp ! Réveillez-vous !"

#. [&"vessa", "Hush! I know that smoke. Come out and finish what you started!"],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e3_02.gd:129
msgid "Hush! I know that smoke. Come out and finish what you started!"
msgstr "Hush ! Je connais cette fumée. Montre-toi et finis ce que tu as commencé !"

#. [&"vey", "I know those knives. Not in my girl's camp. Not twice."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e3_02.gd:131
msgid "I know those knives. Not in my girl's camp. Not twice."
msgstr "Je connais ces couteaux. Pas dans le camp de ma petite. Pas deux fois."

#. [&"malrik", "Two. Ysolde will count her sacks at dawn and come up short."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e3_02.gd:132
msgid "Two. Ysolde will count her sacks at dawn and come up short."
msgstr "Deux. Ysolde comptera ses sacs à l'aube, et il en manquera."

#. [&"torvald", "Your shadows are thorough, Malrik. I am not certain that is a compliment."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e3_02.gd:133
msgid "Your shadows are thorough, Malrik. I am not certain that is a compliment."
msgstr "Tes ombres sont minutieuses, Malrik. Je ne suis pas certain que ce soit un compliment."

#. [&"hush", "Four. The camp will wake hungry, Bishop."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e3_02.gd:134
msgid "Four. The camp will wake hungry, Bishop."
msgstr "Quatre. Le camp se réveillera affamé, Évêque."

#. [&"malrik", "Good. Come home. Bring the night with you."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e3_02.gd:135
msgid "Good. Come home. Bring the night with you."
msgstr "Bien. Rentre. Ramène la nuit avec toi."

#. [&"narrator", "First light. On Lark Hill, Vessa found her wagons. She did not wait."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e3_02.gd:136
msgid "First light. On Lark Hill, Vessa found her wagons. She did not wait."
msgstr "Les premières lueurs. Sur Lark Hill, Vessa a trouvé ses chariots. Elle n'a pas attendu."

#. [&"vessa", "MALRIK! You sent the knife-woman into my camp AGAIN?"],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e3_02.gd:137
msgid "MALRIK! You sent the knife-woman into my camp AGAIN?"
msgstr "MALRIK ! Tu as ENCORE envoyé la femme aux couteaux dans mon camp ?"

#. [&"malrik", "I sent her to the wagons. You should be flattered she skipped your tent."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e3_02.gd:138
msgid "I sent her to the wagons. You should be flattered she skipped your tent."
msgstr "Je l'ai envoyée aux chariots. Tu devrais être flattée qu'elle ait sauté ta tente."

#. [&"malrik", "Stand with me, Hush. In daylight, for once."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e3_02.gd:139
msgid "Stand with me, Hush. In daylight, for once."
msgstr "Reste avec moi, Hush. En plein jour, pour une fois."

#. [&"obren", "Let me do more than beat, Bishop. Let me help."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e3_02.gd:140
msgid "Let me do more than beat, Bishop. Let me help."
msgstr "Laisse-moi faire plus que battre, Évêque. Laisse-moi t'aider."

#. [&"malrik", "Not today. Today I have a knife."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e3_02.gd:141
msgid "Not today. Today I have a knife."
msgstr "Pas aujourd'hui. Aujourd'hui, j'ai un couteau."

#. [&"ysolde", "Then the people go south today. All of them. The road is safer than this hill."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e3_02.gd:142
msgid "Then the people go south today. All of them. The road is safer than this hill."
msgstr "Alors les gens partent vers le sud aujourd'hui. Tous. La route est plus sûre que cette colline."

#. [&"hush", "There is always another night, Bishop."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e3_02.gd:143
msgid "There is always another night, Bishop."
msgstr "Il y a toujours une autre nuit, Évêque."

#. [&"malrik", "And every one of them is mine."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e3_02.gd:144
msgid "And every one of them is mine."
msgstr "Et chacune d'elles est à moi."

#. [&"hush", "The knife bends... Not tonight. Not..."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e3_02.gd:145
msgid "The knife bends... Not tonight. Not..."
msgstr "Le couteau plie... Pas ce soir. Pas..."

#. [&"narrator", "Dawn came up over Lark Hill, and the wagons rolled on."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e3_02.gd:146
msgid "Dawn came up over Lark Hill, and the wagons rolled on."
msgstr "L'aube s'est levée sur Lark Hill, et les chariots ont continué leur route."

#. [&"malrik", "Struck down at sunrise. How very Vessa."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e3_02.gd:147
msgid "Struck down at sunrise. How very Vessa."
msgstr "Abattu au lever du soleil. Bien du Vessa, ça."

#. "The ford fell at dusk. Ysolde held her hill until the light was gone, and now both armies sleep in their armo
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e3_02.gd:150
msgid "The ford fell at dusk. Ysolde held her hill until the light was gone, and now both armies sleep in their armour, a river apart, while the villagers of Evenmead huddle in tents behind Lark Hill."
msgstr "Le gué est tombé au crépuscule. Ysolde a tenu sa colline jusqu'à la fin du jour, et maintenant les deux armées dorment dans leurs armures, une rivière entre elles, pendant que les villageois d'Evenmead se serrent dans des tentes derrière Lark Hill."

#. "Hungry armies march slowly. Four supply wagons came up the south road today: the villagers' winter grain, the
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e3_02.gd:151
msgid "Hungry armies march slowly. Four supply wagons came up the south road today: the villagers' winter grain, the Fire army's arrows, its lamp oil, its riders' fodder. Malrik wants all four spoiled before the sun is up."
msgstr "Une armée affamée marche lentement. Quatre chariots de ravitaillement sont montés par la route du sud aujourd'hui : le grain d'hiver des villageois, les flèches de l'armée du Feu, son huile à lampe, le fourrage de ses cavaliers. Malrik veut les quatre gâtés avant le lever du soleil."

#. "He is sending the knife that never misses. She missed once, at Emberfall. Tonight is another night.",
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e3_02.gd:152
msgid "He is sending the knife that never misses. She missed once, at Emberfall. Tonight is another night."
msgstr "Il envoie le couteau qui ne manque jamais sa cible. Elle l'a manquée une fois, à Emberfall. Ce soir est une autre nuit."

#. const BRIEFING_LINE := "Enemies see poorly in the dark, and clearly near a fire. Stay out of the light."
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e3_02.gd:154
msgid "Enemies see poorly in the dark, and clearly near a fire. Stay out of the light."
msgstr "Les ennemis voient mal dans le noir, et très bien près d'un feu. Restez hors de la lumière."

#. const HINT_START := "Stay out of fire-light. A snuffed fire hides you: stand by it 2 s. Enemies who see you ra
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e3_02.gd:155
msgid "Stay out of fire-light. A snuffed fire hides you: stand by it 2 s. Enemies who see you raise an alarm after 3 s; kill them first."
msgstr "Restez hors de la lumière des feux. Un feu étouffé vous cache : restez à côté 2 s. Un ennemi qui vous voit donne l'alarme après 3 s ; tuez-le avant."

#. const HINT_VEIL := "Hush is veiled after 4 s without fighting: only enemies within 3 m see her."
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e3_02.gd:156
msgid "Hush is veiled after 4 s without fighting: only enemies within 3 m see her."
msgstr "Hush est voilée après 4 s sans combattre : seuls les ennemis à moins de 3 m la voient."

#. const HINT_VEY := "Old Vey cannot be hurt tonight. Slip past him veiled, or raise an alarm far away to draw hi
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e3_02.gd:157
msgid "Old Vey cannot be hurt tonight. Slip past him veiled, or raise an alarm far away to draw him off."
msgstr "Old Vey ne peut pas être blessé ce soir. Passez près de lui voilée, ou donnez l'alarme loin d'ici pour l'attirer ailleurs."

#. const HINT_DAWN := "Your keep is a Citadel now. Select it: V calls Mother Hush, C trains the Nightblood Reaver
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e3_02.gd:158
msgid "Your keep is a Citadel now. Select it: V calls Mother Hush, C trains the Nightblood Reaver."
msgstr "Votre donjon est maintenant une Citadelle. Sélectionnez-le : V appelle Mother Hush, C entraîne le Nightblood Reaver."

